    "text": "firefighternation.com\nwebsite\nKissimmee\nKissimmee (FL) to Assess Fee on Property Owners to Add Firefighters, Shorten Their Workweeks\nBy Tribune Content Agency,\n1 days agoProperty owners in Kissimmee will soon start paying a special fee to help their fire department recruit additional firefighters and allow them to work less-rigorous schedules. After a public hearing Tuesday evening that lasted more than an hour, commissioners voted 4-1 to assess all property owners $105 per parcel of land plus 56 cents per $1,000 of improvements made.",
